<title>CANADA: Saskatchewan Ag details crop growth to June 15.</title>
<headline>Saskatchewan Ag details crop growth to June 15.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saskatchewan Agriculture on</p>
<p>Tuesday detailed the level of crop growth to Sunday.</p>
<p>	   Pre-Emerg Emerge Tiller Joint Shotblade</p>
<p>Cereals</p>
<p>June 15/97  2 pct  33 pct 55 pct  9 pct 1 pct</p>
<p>92/96 Avg   4 pct  31 pct 54 pct 10 pct 1 pct</p>
<p>Canola</p>
<p>June 15/97  5 pct  32 pct 52 pct 11 pct 0 pct</p>
<p>92/96 Avg   9 pct  35 pct 45 pct 11 pct 0 pct</p>
<p>Flax</p>
<p>June 15/97  7 pct  42 pct 47 pct  4 pct 0 pct</p>
<p>92/96 Avg   7 pct  37 pct 50 pct  6 pct 0 pct</p>
<p>Pulse Crops Pre-Em Emerge Veget. Flower</p>
<p>June 15/97  2 pct  38 pct 60 pct  0 pct</p>
<p>June 16/96  7 pct  60 pct 33 pct  0 pct</p>
<p>Fall Cereal Tiller Joint  Shotbl.Headed Dough</p>
<p>June 15/97  6 pct  11 pct 25 pct 50 pct  8 pct</p>
<p>92/96 Avg   4 pct   7 pct 19 pct 62 pct  8 pct</p>
<p>((Gilbert Le Gras, Winnipeg Reuters bureau 204 947 3548))</p>
</text>
